So you can make a Life Day orb, if you'd like.
所以如果你愿意的话，你可以做一个生命日圆球。

1737
01:14:43.400 --> 01:14:46.140
Here is how you're going to do it.
做法如下。

1738
01:14:46.500 --> 01:14:50.160
You are going to buy 12 clear glass ornaments.
你需要买12个透明玻璃装饰球。

1739
01:14:50.460 --> 01:14:50.780
Okay.
好的。

1740
01:14:51.160 --> 01:14:52.680
White glass paint.
白色玻璃漆。

1741
01:14:53.220 --> 01:14:53.300
Okay.
好的。

1742
01:14:53.340 --> 01:14:54.700
And 12 balloon lights.
还有12个气球灯。

1743
01:14:55.380 --> 01:14:59.340
And basically, pour glass paint into a paper bowl.
基本上，把玻璃漆倒进纸碗里。

1744
01:14:59.820 --> 01:15:01.480
Hold the ornament by the top.
捏住装饰球的顶部。

1745
01:15:01.680 --> 01:15:03.720
Dip it in the paint about a third of the way up.
把它浸入漆中，大约三分之一的高度。

1746
01:15:03.900 --> 01:15:04.680
Let it dry.
让它晾干。

1747
01:15:04.680 --> 01:15:08.600
And then when it's dry, put a balloon light inside.
干了之后，把气球灯放进去。

1748
01:15:09.020 --> 01:15:09.680
The end.
结束。

1749
01:15:10.220 --> 01:15:13.020
Or would you like to make a Life Day robe?
或者你想做一件生命日长袍吗？

1750
01:15:15.680 --> 01:15:19.440
Can I just order one for my church?
我可以给我的教会订购一件吗？

1751
01:15:19.760 --> 01:15:20.100
Nope.
不行。

1752
