You're going to need two yards of red fabric.
你需要两码红布。

1754
01:15:23.820 --> 01:15:24.160
Okay.
好的。

1755
01:15:24.360 --> 01:15:24.860
Scissors.
剪刀。

1756
01:15:25.160 --> 01:15:27.380
And two yards of red ribbon.
还有两码红丝带。

1757
01:15:28.100 --> 01:15:29.580
And cut diagonally.
然后对角剪开。

1758
01:15:30.480 --> 01:15:31.460
And that's it?
就这样？

1759
01:15:31.760 --> 01:15:32.300
That's it?
就这样？

1760
01:15:32.300 --> 01:15:32.800
Yes.
是的。

1761
01:15:32.980 --> 01:15:35.600
Measure the fabric to the desired length of the robe.
量好布料，裁出长袍所需的长度。

1762
01:15:36.080 --> 01:15:37.340
Cut a hole in the top.
在顶部剪个洞。

1763
01:15:37.920 --> 01:15:39.180
Put your head through it.
把头穿过去。

1764
01:15:39.300 --> 01:15:39.680
Come on.
得了吧。

1765
01:15:39.680 --> 01:15:39.730
Come on.
别闹了。

1766
01:15:39.800 --> 01:15:40.660
This is like what you...
这就像你……

1767
01:15:40.660 --> 01:15:41.960
And then tie a ribbon around your waiSt.
然后把丝带系在腰间。

1768
01:15:42.060 --> 01:15:42.620
I'm not joking.
我没开玩笑。

1769
01:15:42.740 --> 01:15:43.140
That's it.
就是这样。

1770
01:15:43.320 --> 01:15:43.840
Come on.
得了吧。

1771
01:15:43.920 --> 01:15:47.600
This is what you do, like, if you want to be a ghost at Halloween, but you didn't get
这就像是万圣节你想扮鬼，但没来得及准备服装，

1772
01:15:47.600 --> 01:15:51.820
your costume in time, so you just cut a hole in a pillowcase for your kid and...
于是就给孩子在枕套上剪个洞，然后……

1773
01:15:51.820 --> 01:15:53.740
This did not need a page in a book.
这根本没必要专门写进书里。

1774
01:15:53.980 --> 01:15:54.340
No.
没错。

1775
01:15:54.560 --> 01:15:55.140
This did not.
确实没必要。

1776
01:15:55.160 --> 01:15:55.940
You know what that is?
你知道那是什么吗？

1777
01:15:56.060 --> 01:15:56.280
What?
什么？

1778
01:15:56.460 --> 01:15:56.820
Fluff.
凑数的。

1779
01:15:57.320 --> 01:15:58.640
That's some fluff at the end of the book.
那是书末尾凑数的内容。

1780
01:15:58.660 --> 01:15:59.120
That's some fluff.
纯属凑数。

1781
01:15:59.440 --> 01:15:59.560
Yeah.
是啊。

1782
01:16:00.140 --> 01:16:01.340
Take us to the end of this.
带我们看看结局吧。

1783
01:16:02.260 --> 01:16:03.480
It's special, Ange.
这很特别，安吉。

1784
01:16:03.620 --> 01:16:04.280
Tell us how it ends.
告诉我们结局是什么。

1785
01:16:04.440 --> 01:16:05.320
Well, I sure will.
好吧，我这就说。

1786
01:16:06.380 --> 01:16:09.200
So, everybody pretty much is all gathered together.
大家差不多都聚在一起了。

1787
01:16:09.360 --> 01:16:10.980
There's a lot of folks in robes.
有很多人穿着长袍。

1788
01:16:11.420 --> 01:16:12.340
Han Solo is there.
韩·索罗也在。

1789
01:16:12.440 --> 01:16:13.200
Princess Leia.
莱娅公主。

1790
01:16:13.420 --> 01:16:14.480
Luke Skywalker.
卢克·天行者。

1791
01:16:14.840 --> 01:16:15.780
C-3PO.
C-3PO。

1792
01:16:15.940 --> 01:16:16.600
R2-D2.
R2-D2。

1793
01:16:16.700 --> 01:16:17.320
They're all there.
他们都在那儿。

1794
01:16:17.540 --> 01:16:18.360
Everybody's there.
所有人都到了。

1795
01:16:18.600 --> 01:16:23.420
And Princess Leia has a pretty big speech and then goes into song.
莱娅公主发表了一番感人至深的演讲，然后唱起了歌。

1796
01:16:23.420 --> 01:16:24.800
I think we should hear it.
我觉得我们应该听听。

1797
01:16:25.480 --> 01:16:30.420
This holiday is yours, but we all share with you the hope that this day brings us closer
这个节日属于你们，但我们都与你们分享这份希望，愿这一天让我们更接近

1798
01:16:30.420 --> 01:16:32.500
to freedom and to harmony and to peace.
自由、和谐与和平。

1799
01:16:33.140 --> 01:16:37.900
No matter how different we appear, we're all the same in our struggle against the powers
无论我们外表看起来有多么不同，在对抗邪恶与黑暗势力的斗争中，

1800
01:16:37.900 --> 01:16:38.940
of evil and darkness.
我们都是一样的。

1801
01:16:39.540 --> 01:16:44.520
I hope that this day will always be a day of joy in which we can reconfirm our dedication
我希望这一天永远是充满喜悦的一天，让我们能重申我们的奉献精神

1802
01:16:44.520 --> 01:16:49.200
and our courage and, more than anything else, our love for one another.
以及我们的勇气，最重要的是，我们彼此之间的爱。

1803
01:16:49.240 --> 01:16:49.880
Here's the song.
歌来了。

1804
01:16:50.080 --> 01:16:50.580
It's called...
歌名叫……

1805
01:16:50.580 --> 01:16:52.240
This is the promise of the tree of life.
这是生命之树的承诺。

1806
01:16:52.440 --> 01:16:53.040
Life Day.
生命日。

1807
01:17:00.720 --> 01:17:05.480
This reminds me so much of how I try to sing good at church.
这让我想起我在教堂努力唱歌的样子。

1808
01:17:05.880 --> 01:17:07.080
Ha, ha, ha.
哈哈哈哈。

1809
01:17:07.620 --> 01:17:07.920
Yeah.
是啊。

1810
01:17:08.100 --> 01:17:09.020
I love Carrie Fisher.
我爱凯丽·费雪。

1811
01:17:09.440 --> 01:17:10.860
It's got a little bit of that for me, though.
不过对我来说，确实有那么一点感觉。

1812
01:17:11.180 --> 01:17:11.320
Yeah.
是啊。

1813
01:17:12.980 --> 01:17:19.100
This, incidentally, you're hearing it now, this is set to the main title, music for Star
顺便说一下，你们现在听到的这段音乐，是约翰·威廉姆斯为《星球大战》

1814
01:17:19.100 --> 01:17:20.440
Wars by John WilliaMs.
创作的主题曲。

1815
01:17:20.660 --> 01:17:22.100
Yes, it starts to come in there.
没错，音乐开始切入了。

1816
01:17:26.540 --> 01:17:30.740
As she sings this, everyone slowly files out.
当她唱这首歌时，大家慢慢地排队走了出去。

1817
01:17:30.740 --> 01:17:35.760
Everyone in their robes that they cut a hole in and tied a ribbon around their waist, they're
每个人都穿着长袍，袍子上剪了个洞，腰间系着丝带，他们

1818
01:17:35.760 --> 01:17:39.820
all filing out, and the camera pushes in on Chewbacca's face.
全都排队走了出去，镜头推向楚巴卡的脸。

1819
01:17:39.940 --> 01:17:45.680
He's kind of looking off in the distance, and we see a montage of scenes from the first
他若有所思地望着远方，我们看到了一段《星球大战》第一部电影的

1820
01:17:45.680 --> 01:17:51.460
Star Wars movie, and then it comes back to Chewbacca and his family, and they're sitting
剪辑片段，然后镜头回到楚巴卡和他的家人身上，他们正坐下来

1821
01:17:51.460 --> 01:17:55.200
down for dinner with the gold orbs in the center of their table.
吃晚餐，桌子中央放着金色的球体。

1822
01:17:55.600 --> 01:17:59.680
They bow their heads as if to pray, and the credits roll.
他们低下头仿佛在祈祷，随后字幕滚动。

1823
01:18:00.740 --> 01:18:01.020
Yeah.
是啊。

1824
01:18:01.880 --> 01:18:03.320
There you have it, everybody.
好了，各位，这就是全部内容了。

1825
01:18:03.560 --> 01:18:05.900
The Star Wars Holiday Special.
《星球大战假日特辑》。

1826
01:18:06.400 --> 01:18:06.640
Yeah.
是啊。

1827
01:18:07.180 --> 01:18:08.740
Thank you, Cassie.
谢谢你，凯西。

1828
01:18:09.580 --> 01:18:10.620
Yeah, Cassie.
没错，凯西。

1829
01:18:11.780 --> 01:18:14.580
You are no longer allowed to write into Dear Office, ladies.
女士们，你们以后不准再写信给“亲爱的办公室”栏目了。

1830
01:18:14.840 --> 01:18:16.600
I just want you to know you've been banned.
我只想让你们知道，你们已经被禁了。

1831
01:18:17.100 --> 01:18:17.860
Oh, okay.
哦，好吧。

1832
01:18:19.000 --> 01:18:21.980
I want to know what your review of it, like how many stars out of 10?
我想知道你们的评价，满分10分给几颗星？

1833
01:18:23.400 --> 01:18:23.760
Zero?
零分？

1834
01:18:24.540 --> 01:18:25.220
Zero stars?
零颗星？

1835
01:18:25.380 --> 01:18:26.920
Maybe one star for B.
也许给比·亚瑟一颗星吧。

1836
01:18:26.920 --> 01:18:27.000
B.
比。

1837
01:18:27.000 --> 01:18:27.280
Arthur.
亚瑟。

1838
01:18:27.660 --> 01:18:27.900
Okay.
好吧。

1839
01:18:27.980 --> 01:18:28.080
B.
比。

1840
01:18:28.200 --> 01:18:28.940
Arthur gets a star.
亚瑟值得一颗星。

1841
01:18:29.160 --> 01:18:31.400
IMDb rates it at 2.2 out of 10.
IMDb给它的评分是2.2分（满分10分）。

1842
01:18:31.640 --> 01:18:31.920
Yeah.
是啊。

1843
01:18:34.080 --> 01:18:34.440
Generous.
真慷慨。

1844
01:18:34.600 --> 01:18:35.040
You know what?
你知道吗？

1845
01:18:35.160 --> 01:18:35.280
B.
比。

1846
01:18:35.400 --> 01:18:39.780
Arthur gets a star for me, and so does that first stormtrooper that says, I hate fish.
亚瑟对我来说值得一颗星，还有那个说“我讨厌鱼”的冲锋队员也值得一颗。

1847
01:18:39.920 --> 01:18:40.600
So that's two.
所以是两颗星。

1848
01:18:40.600 --> 01:18:42.580
He gets maybe one and a half star.
他或许能得一颗半星。

1849
01:18:43.400 --> 01:18:45.140
Well, maybe he gets a star.
好吧，也许他能得一颗星。

1850
01:18:46.080 --> 01:18:47.260
Here's what I think it is.
我是这么想的。

1851
01:18:47.500 --> 01:18:47.580
B.
B。

1852
01:18:47.660 --> 01:18:48.540
Arthur gets a star.
亚瑟得了一颗星。

1853
01:18:49.300 --> 01:18:50.180
Harvey Korman.
哈维·科曼。

1854
01:18:50.640 --> 01:18:51.360
Oh, yes.
哦，是的。

1855
01:18:51.620 --> 01:18:51.940
Three characters.
三个角色。

1856
01:18:52.120 --> 01:18:53.180
Yes, he gets a star.
是的，他得了一颗星。

1857
01:18:53.300 --> 01:18:57.060
He gets a star, and then a half a star for the stormtrooper who doesn't like fish.
他得了一颗星，然后那个不喜欢鱼的冲锋队队员得了半颗星。

1858
01:18:57.840 --> 01:18:58.760
There's our rating.
这就是我们的评分。

1859
01:18:59.340 --> 01:19:00.160
Two and a half stars.
两颗半星。

1860
01:19:00.640 --> 01:19:04.840
And Jenna, can I ask, do you still consider yourself a Star Wars fan?
珍娜，我能问一下吗，你还认为自己是《星球大战》的粉丝吗？

1861
01:19:04.840 --> 01:19:07.340
Well, I never considered myself a fan.
嗯，我从来没把自己当成粉丝。

1862
01:19:07.620 --> 01:19:09.740
This didn't turn the tides for you?
这没能让你改观吗？

1863
01:19:09.820 --> 01:19:10.440
It didn't help you.
它没能帮到你。

1864
01:19:10.440 --> 01:19:12.380
No, it did not turn me into a Star Wars fan.
没有，它没能让我变成《星球大战》的粉丝。

1865
01:19:12.500 --> 01:19:14.520
Ainsley, have you ever seen Star Wars?
安斯利，你看过《星球大战》吗？

1866
01:19:14.640 --> 01:19:14.940
Ever.
从来没看过。

1867
01:19:15.300 --> 01:19:18.640
Not until 2019, I think.
我想直到2019年才看。

1868
01:19:18.740 --> 01:19:19.800
I saw the first two.
我看了前两部。

1869
01:19:20.100 --> 01:19:20.520
Okay.
好的。

1870
01:19:20.680 --> 01:19:21.200
So you're with me.
所以你和我想的一样。

1871
01:19:21.200 --> 01:19:21.920
I have no idea what happened.
我完全不知道发生了什么。

1872
01:19:22.100 --> 01:19:23.420
As an adult, yeah.
作为成年人看的，是的。

1873
01:19:23.580 --> 01:19:25.080
And I did like them.
而且我确实喜欢它们。

1874
01:19:25.240 --> 01:19:27.460
I liked those three, but I'm stopping.
我喜欢那三部，但我打算就此打住。

1875
01:19:27.460 --> 01:19:31.700
I don't need to see any more of the world.
我不需要再看这个世界的更多内容了。

1876
01:19:31.700 --> 01:19:36.300
But I really did enjoy Star Wars, Empire Strikes Back, and Return of the Jedi.
但我确实很喜欢《星球大战》、《帝国反击战》和《绝地归来》。

1877
01:19:36.560 --> 01:19:38.720
But that is, I'm done.
但也就到此为止了，我结束了。

1878
01:19:39.100 --> 01:19:40.800
And now I've seen this.
现在我又看了这一部。

1879
01:19:41.840 --> 01:19:43.580
I will watch all of them.
我会把它们全部看完。

1880
01:19:44.780 --> 01:19:48.120
This is my least favorite in the fandom.
这是我在整个系列中最不喜欢的一部。

1881
01:19:48.780 --> 01:19:50.300
But I will watch them all.
但我会把它们全部看完。

1882
01:19:50.580 --> 01:19:54.620
Well, a big thank you to Ainsley for joining us today for this recording.
非常感谢安斯利今天来参加我们的录制。

1883
01:19:54.620 --> 01:19:57.620
And thank you so much for your outline.
也非常感谢你的大纲。

1884
01:19:57.860 --> 01:19:59.180
For watching it.
感谢你观看它。

1885
01:19:59.180 --> 01:20:03.780
We're sorry, but we had to have you here with us to bear witness to this moment.
很抱歉，但我们必须让你在这里和我们一起见证这一刻。

1886
01:20:04.020 --> 01:20:10.760
And we feel like, as a gift, you should be the one to take home the Star Wars Life Day cookbook.
我们觉得，作为礼物，你应该把这本《星球大战》生命日食谱带回家。

1887
01:20:11.100 --> 01:20:14.040
I am so honored, and I will take it.
我深感荣幸，我会收下的。

1888
01:20:14.360 --> 01:20:15.020
Thank you.
谢谢。

1889
01:20:15.240 --> 01:20:17.860
Please make one of the robes and show it to us someday.
请一定要做一道里面的菜，改天展示给我们看。

1890
01:20:18.180 --> 01:20:18.500
Yes.
好的。

1891
01:20:18.900 --> 01:20:19.200
Okay.
好的。

1892
01:20:19.720 --> 01:20:26.020
Well, everyone, if you have an idea for an upcoming Office Ladies 6.0 episode, we'd love to hear from you.
各位，如果你对即将到来的《办公室女郎》6.0集有什么想法，我们很乐意听听。

1893
01:20:26.140 --> 01:20:28.200
And if your name is Cassie, sorry, do not.
如果你的名字叫凯西，抱歉，请不要提。

1894
01:20:28.800 --> 01:20:34.640
Angela is going to post a link to our Dear Office Ladies mailbag in the Office Ladies pod stories today.
安吉拉今天会在《办公室女郎》的播客故事里发布一个链接，通往我们的“亲爱的办公室女郎”信箱。

1895
01:20:34.860 --> 01:20:37.160
And remember, it can really be any topic.
记住，任何话题都可以。

1896
01:20:37.480 --> 01:20:39.660
Just what do you want to hear us talk about?
你到底想听我们聊些什么？

1897
01:20:40.320 --> 01:20:43.700
Please, though, can I have a break from fantasy sci-fi?
不过拜托，能让我从奇幻科幻题材里休息一下吗？

1898
01:20:44.200 --> 01:20:45.200
I'm begging you.
我求求你们了。

1899
01:20:45.360 --> 01:20:47.400
Can we make Angela watch a horror movie?
我们能让安吉拉看一部恐怖片吗？

1900
01:20:47.700 --> 01:20:49.320
No, I don't want to watch a horror movie.
不，我不想看恐怖片。

1901
01:20:49.440 --> 01:20:50.620
I hate horror movies.
我讨厌恐怖电影。

1902
01:20:50.760 --> 01:20:51.040
Maybe.
也许吧。

1903
01:20:51.400 --> 01:20:51.820
No.
不。

1904
01:20:52.200 --> 01:20:53.500
Write in and let us know.
写信告诉我们吧。

1905
01:20:53.640 --> 01:20:58.260
And please join us next Wednesday for our interview with Kathy Bates.
下周三请继续收听我们对凯西·贝茨的采访。

1906
01:20:58.580 --> 01:20:59.540
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1907
01:20:59.540 --> 01:21:00.640
We were so excited.
我们当时太激动了。

1908
01:21:01.040 --> 01:21:01.960
We'll see you then.
到时候见。

1909
01:21:02.740 --> 01:21:06.300
This sherbet and stew are such a disgusting combo.
这雪酪和炖菜搭配在一起真是恶心透了。

1910
01:21:06.300 --> 01:21:09.120
It's coming back on me in a gross, gross way.
那种味道一直在反胃，真是太恶心了。

1911
01:21:09.240 --> 01:21:10.500
I drank my whole drink.
我把饮料全喝光了。

1912
01:21:10.800 --> 01:21:12.420
Yeah, I feel weird.
是啊，我感觉怪怪的。

1913
01:21:12.420 --> 01:21:13.740
I feel gross.
我觉得好恶心。

1914
01:21:14.400 --> 01:21:16.180
I think we should end on that.
我想我们该就此结束了。

1915
01:21:16.360 --> 01:21:16.520
Yeah.
没错。

1916
01:21:17.760 --> 01:21:26.550
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies.
感谢收听《办公室女士》。

1917
